ass=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\" rowspan=\"9\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"lamannia\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/page/File:Glorious_Shield.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Glorious_Shield.png/420px-Glorious_Shield.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"217\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Glorious_Shield.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption>This screenshot is from <a href=\"/page/Lamannia\" title=\"Lamannia\">Lamannia</a>.<br />Please <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ddowiki.com/index.php?title=Special:Upload&amp;wpDestFile=Glorious_Shield.png&amp;wpUploadDescription=&amp;wpLicense=DDO%20screenshot&amp;wpWatchthis=1&amp;wpIgnoreWarning=0\">upload</a></span> a version from a live world,<br />then remove <code>&#123;&#123;&#32;<a href=\"/page/Template:Lamannia\" title=\"Template:Lamannia\">Lamannia</a>&#32;&#125;&#125;</code> from <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ddowiki.com/index.php?title=File:Glorious_Shield.png&amp;action=edit#editform\"><span class=\"edit-link\" style=\"display: inherit;\" title=\"the file page\">the file page</span></a></span>.<br />(If the appearance is unchanged, you can skip the uploading step.)</figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>This glorious shield shines with your victories.</i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<p>Formerly found in the <a href=\"/page/Lamannia\" title=\"Lamannia\">Lamannia</a> <a href=\"/page/Test_Dojo\" title=\"Test Dojo\">Test Dojo</a>, the visual styling of this cosmetic shield suggests it was meant to be included with the <a href=\"/page/Fables_of_the_Feywild\" title=\"Fables of the Feywild\">Fables of the Feywild</a> Mosaic Armor set. Despite this it appears the item never left Lamannia.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817044411\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.155 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27166/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2788/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n122.06%  167.231     61 Template:IO\n100.00%  137.013      1 -total\n 84.00%  115.093      1 Template:Named_item\n 78.96%  108.188      1 Template:Named_Shield\n 45.78%   62.724      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.57%   54.218      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.83%   53.206      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 38.11%   52.219      2 Template:InCategory\n 15.97%   21.877      1 Template:Lamanni